3-(3-Chlorophenyl)-5-chloro-1-(3-ethoxyphenyl)-2(1H)- pyrazinone (39),
yield (32%). mp: 99-100 °C (DCM-hexane). 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ 8.45 (s, 1H),
8.35-8.34 (d, J = 8.2, 1H), 7.44-7.32 (m, 4H), 7.0-6.9 (m, 3H), 4.08-4.01
(q, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H,), 1.44-1.39 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3): δ
160.2, 154.1, 151.5, 140.1, 136.7, 134.6, 131.1, 130.8, 129.7, 129.6,
127.8, 126.9, 126.7, 118.0, 116.3, 112.6, 64.3, 15.0. HRMS (EI) Calcd for
