3-(3-Chlorophenyl)-5-chloro-1-(3-trifluromethylphenyl)-
2(1H)-pyrazinone(25), yield (29%). mp: 100-101 °C (DCM-hexane). 1H NMR
(CDCl3): δ 8.4 (s, 1H), 8.33-8.30 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 7.71-7.67 (m, 4H),
7.48-7.41 (m, 3H), 7.30 (s, 1H). 13C NMR (CDCl3): 153.9, 152.0, 139.5,
