3-(3-Chlorophenyl)-5-chloro-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-2(1H)- pyrazinone (52),
yield (28%). mp: 134-135 °C (DCM-hexane). 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ 8.48 (d, 2H,
J = 8.7 Hz), 7.52-7.70 (m, 3H), 7.30 (m, 1H), 7.12 (s, 1H), 6.85 (m, 2H),
